<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Jul 16.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Jul 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Jul 122.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 81.00 asa 80.00 Oct/Dec 86.00/86.50</p>
<p>Avon range asa 79.75 Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Jul 80.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire Sep 80.00</p>
<p>Hamshire Jul 80.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to South Humberside Jul/Aug 75.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jul/Aug 74.00/74.50</p>
<p>Avon range asa 77.75</p>
<p>Tilbury Spot 75.00</p>
